{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_103_maira_2-title\">MAIRA-2</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">相较 MAIRA-1，MAIRA-2 增加多视图/既往/报告上下文，并把报告句子与生成式 bounding-box token 绑定。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Extends MAIRA-1 with multi-view (AP/PA + lateral), prior study/report longitudinal context, and interleaved quantized bounding-box tokens for grounded reporting.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">当前正位/侧位胸片、既往正位胸片与报告、indication、technique、comparison 和任务提示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Current frontal &amp; lateral CXR, prior CXR, prior report, indication, technique, comparison + task prompt</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">普通 Findings、逐句关联边界框的 grounded Findings，或短语定位框</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Ungrounded Findings, spatially grounded Findings (linking each clinical sentence to bounding boxes), or phrase grounding</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(b) · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.04449\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_103_maira_2')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_103_maira_2')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MAIRA-2 original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(b)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/69f42b1bd8823224dc8d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(b) · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_103_maira_2\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_103_maira_2')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_103_maira_2\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">当前正/侧位胸片</span><span class=\"lang-en\">chest X-ray (CXR</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">正位为主要定位画布，侧位提供补充视角</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests current frontal &amp; lateral cxr, prior cxr, prior report, indication, technique, comparison + task prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"正位为主要定位画布，侧位提供补充视角\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests current frontal &amp; lateral cxr, prior cxr, prior report, indication, technique, comparison + task prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"当前正/侧位胸片\" data-node-name-en=\"chest X-ray (CXR\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">当前正/侧位胸片</span><span class=\"lang-en\">chest X-ray (CXR</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">正位为主要定位画布，侧位提供补充视角</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests current frontal &amp; lateral cxr, prior cxr, prior report, indication, technique, comparison + task prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用于比较时间变化，可为空\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"既往图像与报告\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">既往图像与报告</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用于比较时间变化，可为空</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以交错文本 token 提供真实报告上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Indication/Technique/Comparison within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Indication/Technique/Comparison\" data-node-name-en=\"Indication/Technique/Comparison\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Indication/Technique/Comparison</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以交错文本 token 提供真实报告上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Indication/Technique/Comparison within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"87M 参数胸片视觉 encoder\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"冻结 RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B\" data-node-name-en=\"RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B</span><span class=\"lang-en\">RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">87M 参数胸片视觉 encoder</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs RAD-DINO-MAIRA-2 ViT-B within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从零训练，将一个或多个图像 token 映射到语言维度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MLP adapter within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"四层 MLP adapter\" data-node-name-en=\"MLP adapter\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四层 MLP adapter</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MLP adapter</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从零训练，将一个或多个图像 token 映射到语言维度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MLP adapter within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"接收交错图像与文本上下文，按任务提示生成\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs fine-tuning Vicuna-7B v1.5 within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"完整微调 Vicuna-7B v1.5\" data-node-name-en=\"fine-tuning Vicuna-7B v1.5\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">完整微调 Vicuna-7B v1.5</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fine-tuning Vicuna-7B v1.5</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">接收交错图像与文本上下文，按任务提示生成</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs fine-tuning Vicuna-7B v1.5 within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可生成对象标记与量化 box，实现描述和定位绑定\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs token within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"句子—对象—框 token\" data-node-name-en=\"token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">句子—对象—框 token</span><span class=\"lang-en\">token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可生成对象标记与量化 box，实现描述和定位绑定</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs token within the core longitudinal grounded box report mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"普通报告、grounded 报告与 phrase grounding 共享生成训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Grounded/ungrounded multi-task LM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Grounded/ungrounded 多任务 LM\" data-node-name-en=\"Grounded/ungrounded multi-task LM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Grounded/ungrounded 多任务 LM</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Grounded/ungrounded multi-task LM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">普通报告、grounded 报告与 phrase grounding 共享生成训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Grounded/ungrounded multi-task LM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"解析为纯文本或带边界框的句子序列\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces ungrounded findings, spatially grounded findings (linking each clinical sentence to bounding boxes), or phrase grounding via output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"可定位报告输出\" data-node-name-en=\"output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_103_maira_2', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可定位报告输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">解析为纯文本或带边界框的句子序列</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces ungrounded findings, spatially grounded findings (linking each clinical sentence t