-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"206.243085\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"210.058761\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"214.747791\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g16-39\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"221.429728\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g7-0\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"226.844216\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"230.945449\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g16-24\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"238.397492\" xlink:href=\"#m103_g4-1\" y=\"-66.410963\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">纯文本报告难追溯到影像证据，模型错误不易审计</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Un-grounded text reports cannot be visually audited on the image, and single-image inputs ignore longitudinal interval change.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在报告生成时同时输出与叙述实体对应的图像区域定位</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Condition the LLM on full longitudinal clinical context (multi-view + prior study/report) while emitting spatial bounding-box tokens inline with findings.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把检测式 grounding 与长文本生成统一，并接收当前/既往胸片、既往报告、检查指征及比较信息</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unified sequence generation of clinical prose and quantized spatial coordinates + comprehensive longitudinal chest X-ray context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于成人胸片的可定位报告与研究性人机复核</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Sets the standard for auditable, spatially grounded adult chest X-ray report drafting and human-in-the-loop review.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可审计报告生成的重要方向；grounding 正确不等于诊断正确</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Major step toward verifiable clinical VLMs; accurate box localization still requires mandatory radiologist verification.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把放射科医师实际使用的当前、既往与检查指征上下文一并送入模型。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">用同一自回归序列同时表达所见文本和与句子关联的边界框。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">普通报告、grounded 报告和 phrase grounding 进行多任务训练。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Condition the LLM on full longitudinal clinical context (multi-view + prior study/report) while emitting spatial bounding-box tokens inline with findings.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Unified sequence generation of clinical prose and quantized spatial coordinates + comprehensive longitudinal chest X-ray context.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Longitudinal Multi-View Conditioned Autoregressive Generation of Interleaved Text &amp; Box Tokens.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">定位框使报告句子能够回指当前正位胸片区域，便于人工核验。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">框只覆盖可局灶定位的发现，正常解剖、弥漫性改变和错误推理仍不能因此自动验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Sets the standard for auditable, spatially grounded adult chest X-ray report drafting and human-in-the-loop review.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Major step toward verifiable clinical VLMs; accurate box localization still requires mandatory radiologist verification.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.04449\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>MAIRA-2: Grounded Radiology Report Generation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/microsoft/maira-2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
